427	<section class="container" id="apipath">
428	  <div class="section-title">
429	    <div class="num">02 · API Implementation</div>
430	    <h2>Zero-Training Route — Pure Mistral API</h2>
431	    <p>Use Mistral's hosted model with MCP tool-calling. No fine-tuning. No GPU costs. Works today.</p>
